WEBVTT

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:09.960
Driven by the darkness in my heart, I activated The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:14.960
I lost my bond with my monsters and fell into Rafael's trap.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:18.760
I did what couldn't be undone.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:27.250
When I lost, I also lost what's most important to me - my partner!

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:48.070
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:55.210
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:55.990 --> 00:01:01.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:07.860
I was searching for your smile

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:15.230
With our memories fading

00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:22.310
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:29.210
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:36.440
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:55.330 --> 00:02:00.970
Torn Soul

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:06.050
Hurry!

00:02:06.050 --> 00:02:07.240
Willpower!

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:09.330
If they get away...

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:11.980
We'll be losers for life!

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:30.230
You're...

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:34.480
No!  Wait!

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:36.760
Let us join you!

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:39.400
What do you mean?

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:41.850
I'm Japan's champion!

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:44.180
And I finished second!

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:47.650
If Mai Kujaku's good enough for you, so are we!

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:51.020
Please let us join you!

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:11.230
Anzu!  Look!

00:03:12.590 --> 00:03:14.240
They're back!

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:24.810
Yugi!  Everyone!

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:26.000
They're all okay!

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.250
Darling!

00:03:28.990 --> 00:03:30.840
Thank goodness!  You won!

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:35.260
Yugi!  We believed in you!

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:38.260
Hold up.  You have it wrong.

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.150
What do you mean?

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:44.150
Yugi...

00:03:44.150 --> 00:03:45.500
...didn't win.

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:50.870
Yugi lost.

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:52.240
No way!

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:58.050
Because when you duel Doma, the loser loses their soul.

00:03:58.050 --> 00:04:00.250
And he did lose his soul.

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:04.410
But Yugi's right there-

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:08.930
No way...

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:11.220
That can't be true!

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:13.930
Yugi!  Change into my darling!

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:17.330
Rebecca, I'm sorry.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:20.400
My partner is...

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:27.160
Partner!

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:31.260
I trust you, my other... self.

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:34.450
Partner!

00:04:39.570 --> 00:04:42.190
He was taken instead of me.

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:48.570
Why?

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:52.090
You're the one who entered my darling's body!

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:56.210
Why are you here while my darling's soul is gone?

00:04:58.100 --> 00:05:00.900
It's your fault!

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:04.720
Give the original Yugi-  Give my darling back!

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:06.480
Give him back!

00:05:07.650 --> 00:05:09.070
Rebecca...

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:13.690
Rebecca is right.

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:15.430
Yugi...

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:22.040
My partner was against using The Seal of Orichalcos to the very end.

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:24.430
But I...

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:30.310
I activate this card from my hand!

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:38.130
He's gone because of me.

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:41.650
Stop it, Yugi!

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:43.920
It's all my fault.

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:46.760
I said stop!

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:50.760
Jonouchi!

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:54.500
We still have a chance to get the other Yugi back!

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:57.500
So get yourself together!

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:03.160
What happened to Yugi Muto's - the King of Duelists' - pride?

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:09.770
But no one's been able to defeat Doma's Three Musketeers yet.

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:13.750
Don't say that!

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:15.190
S-Sorry...

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:16.130
It's fine.

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:18.760
It's the truth.

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:23.760
We may never had the power to defeat Doma to begin with.

00:06:24.930 --> 00:06:25.760
Yugi...

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:34.980
It's the middle of the business district.

00:06:34.980 --> 00:06:37.210
What are we doing here?

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:06.050
I thought Doma'd be a weird group that would take us to a secret lair.

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:09.470
But they're camouflaged as a large corporation.

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:16.320
The person you're about to meet will decide what to do with you.

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:18.990
So don't be rude.

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:26.990
We're back.

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:37.000
Master Dartz, we captured the Nameless Pharaoh's soul, as you ordered.

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:39.500
Well done, Rafael.

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:41.160
Pharaoh?

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:42.010
What's that?

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:44.500
I'd love to congratulate you...

00:07:46.550 --> 00:07:49.510
But you weren't the first to succeed.

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:53.520
Look at this.

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:56.520
What's that?

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:11.720
That's...

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:12.640
Yugi?

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:17.400
It's Yugi, not the Nameless Pharaoh.

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:18.870
What do you mean?

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:23.080
There are two personalities inside Yugi Muto.

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:25.940
One is the Nameless Pharaoh.

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:30.050
The other is the vessel.

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:31.520
Vessel?

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:34.520
Yugi is the Nameless Pharaoh?

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:37.030
What do they mean by vessel?

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:41.370
Rafael, you did defeat the Nameless Pharaoh.

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:47.040
But The Seal of Orichalcos captured the vessel.

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:48.540
That means...

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:51.270
The Nameless Pharaoh is safe.

00:08:52.660 --> 00:08:54.010
Then I'll go again.

00:08:56.670 --> 00:08:57.580
C'mon!

00:08:57.580 --> 00:08:58.410
Right!

00:09:01.660 --> 00:09:03.180
Instead of him...

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:04.970
Let us do it!

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:08.140
I mean, please let us do it!

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:09.760
Who are you?

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:13.900
I knew he didn't notice us.

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:16.630
Insector Haga and Dinosaur Ryuzaki.

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:20.480
Self-proclaimed Japan champion and runner-up.

00:09:20.480 --> 00:09:21.850
It's not self-proclaimed!

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:23.240
It's the truth!

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:27.260
We're serious!  We want to be stronger!

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:30.380
Ever since Yugi and Jonouchi showed up...

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:34.350
Go, Summoned Skull!

00:09:34.350 --> 00:09:35.920
Magic Lightning!

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:44.830
Time Magic!

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:52.600
What's going to happen?

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:02.910
My Red-Eyes...

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:06.840
They've constantly humiliated us!

00:10:07.060 --> 00:10:10.720
They destroyed my pride as a duelist!

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:13.280
We want to be stronger!

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:18.030
Just one time, I want to triumph over Yugi and Jonouchi!

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:23.430
Please give us your power!

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:25.030
Please!

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:31.620
The Nameless Pharaoh and Jonouchi are duelists chosen by the legendary dragons.

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:34.340
They won't be easy to defeat.

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:37.260
That's why we need your power!

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:40.050
We can beat them if we have power!

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:45.370
You must show commitment to acquire our power.

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:47.070
To beat them...

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:48.500
...we'll do anything!

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:50.560
Very well.

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:56.800
Take these.

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:02.300
What?  It's blank.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:04.540
We're being serious!

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.540
So am I.

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:19.050
They're...

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:24.560
Orichalcos fragments that'll give those cards life.

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:27.300
Orichalcos fragments?

00:11:27.930 --> 00:11:31.320
These fragments will test the darkness in your hearts.

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:36.400
You can have these fragments if you're worthy for Doma.

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:37.560
But...

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:44.410
If you're unworthy, your souls will be sealed inside cards.

00:11:46.110 --> 00:11:47.420
Our souls?

00:11:47.740 --> 00:11:49.950
What's wrong?  Scared?

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:52.620
No I'm not!

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:55.120
Yeah!  We can't be scared!

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:57.800
Or we'll be losers forever!

00:11:57.800 --> 00:11:59.430
Yeah!  Let's do it!

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:02.900
Let's go!

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:03.740
Yeah.

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:05.320
Here we go!

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:32.670
They've failed.

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:34.430
They're not worthy.

00:12:39.100 --> 00:12:42.790
No good!  It's impossible for us!

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:44.570
Don't give up!

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:47.580
You want to lose your soul as a loser?

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:49.610
We're almost there!

00:12:49.610 --> 00:12:51.380
You're right!

00:12:51.380 --> 00:12:53.110
I swear I'll get it!

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:12.220
This is The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:14.270
With this card...

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:18.270
You're now members of Doma.

00:13:24.060 --> 00:13:28.480
Use these cards to build your strongest decks.

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:31.220
There's so many!

00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:34.220
You have every card?

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:37.220
Except for the God Cards and Legendary Dragons.

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:40.230
Aww, you don't have the God Cards?

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:43.730
Even if we did, you're not good enough to use them.

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:47.940
Well, even without the God Cards...

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:49.740
This is plenty!

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:53.650
Insector Haga and Dinosaur Ryuzaki.

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:58.250
Defeat the Nameless Pharaoh and Jonouchi.

00:13:58.660 --> 00:14:02.250
You have the power of the Orichalcos.

00:14:03.310 --> 00:14:04.620
Yes sir!

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:08.960
Doma's goal is to end human history?

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:12.370
Yeah.  That's what he said.

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:15.970
But that's easier said than done.

00:14:15.970 --> 00:14:17.320
Yeah.

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:18.970
But they can.

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:24.070
We've already seen how they'll do it.

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:26.070
You don't mean...

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:42.720
I see.  By using that monster.

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:48.420
Doma's Three Musketeers and Mai said that they need your souls.

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:55.240
They want to sacrifice our souls to resurrect that monster.

00:14:55.480 --> 00:14:57.020
Oh no...

00:14:57.480 --> 00:15:00.390
They're more than we can handle!

00:15:00.390 --> 00:15:02.180
Let's call the police!

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:03.250
It won't help.

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:08.880
They burned my grandpa's research, so we have no proof.

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:12.750
Who would believe such an absurd story?

00:15:13.020 --> 00:15:16.990
That's true, but maybe there's a clue in the undersea ruins!

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:19.360
They've beaten us to the punch.

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:25.400
Doma did this, too?

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:28.000
Without hard evidence...

00:15:29.060 --> 00:15:30.700
Don't give up.

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:32.400
Grandpa.

00:15:32.400 --> 00:15:33.980
Are you okay?

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:36.170
Sorry to worry you.

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:41.640
I can't sleep after hearing Rebecca cry.

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:44.950
I heard what you said.

00:15:45.180 --> 00:15:48.820
Professor, have you learned anything new?

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:56.330
I haven't deciphered all the inscriptions, but Doma's true identity is likely...

00:15:56.540 --> 00:16:04.370
Descendants of those who lived in Atlantis - known as Earth's paradise - long ago.

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:06.360
No way!

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:12.080
Isn't Atlantis a legendary continent that sank into the ocean long ago?

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:14.710
Atlantis isn't a legend.

00:16:14.710 --> 00:16:19.300
The inscriptions in the undersea ruins were the chronicles of Atlantis.

00:16:19.300 --> 00:16:21.190
Their history.

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:24.330
The history of Atlantis...

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:30.940
Atlantis was highly civilized and ruled over a large domain.

00:16:30.940 --> 00:16:36.910
Known as Earth's paradise, they believed peace would last forever.

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:43.930
But a king summoned a monster that suddenly destroyed it.

00:16:43.930 --> 00:16:46.350
A king...

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:51.780
Nameless Pharaoh, there's also darkness in your heart.

00:16:52.710 --> 00:16:57.010
Can you truly say you were a good Pharaoh?

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:02.080
Yugi, what's wrong?

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:03.020
It's nothing.

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:10.580
They say Atlantis's royal family received god's power from a strange stone.

00:17:11.360 --> 00:17:14.810
It's that rock they have!  And then?

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:18.140
Unfortunately, that's all I could decipher.

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:19.550
Dammit!

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:22.400
Why are you mad?

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:24.300
Think about it!

00:17:24.300 --> 00:17:28.800
They came to erase the Professor's work.  That means...

00:17:28.800 --> 00:17:34.910
Ah!  The inscriptions said something that would hurt Doma!

00:17:34.910 --> 00:17:39.360
I see.  Unexpected good thinking, Jonouchi!

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:41.800
But the ruins are...

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:42.800
No.

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:50.810
The Florida museum I used as my base of operations still has my research materials.

00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:55.050
So there's still a chance to decipher the inscriptions!

00:17:55.460 --> 00:17:56.280
Yes.

00:17:56.520 --> 00:17:58.520
Let's go, Yugi!

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:03.520
Let's uncover Doma's secrets and save the other Yugi and Mai!

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:06.530
Well said, Jonouchi!

00:18:06.530 --> 00:18:10.070
Let's get there before Doma!

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:13.760
But Florida is really far from here.

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:19.760
Due to the Duel Monsters incident, our stock price keeps falling.

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:25.260
And someone controls over 40% of the shares.  At this rate, the company will-

00:18:25.260 --> 00:18:27.440
I know that!

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:31.730
More importantly, have you found out which company is backing Doma?

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:36.220
They have enough money to buy Kaiba Corporation!

00:18:36.480 --> 00:18:40.970
They're somewhere!  Use more resources to find out who!

00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:43.230
Damn.

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:47.730
Big brother, do you think he'll come again?

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:51.440
I understand how he feels.

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:55.370
This is my...

00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:57.610
This belonged to my brother!

00:18:58.320 --> 00:19:00.610
Due to you, my brother...

00:19:01.100 --> 00:19:03.220
Your company killed him!

00:19:03.440 --> 00:19:07.200
I'd be like him if anything happened to you.

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:11.160
So I don't want you to fight him.

00:19:11.160 --> 00:19:14.680
He's only thinking about his brother.

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:16.340
He isn't a bad guy!

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:17.110
Mokuba.

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:24.500
Unless I defeat Doma, there's no future for Kaiba Land or Kaiba Corporation.

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:26.780
Big brother...

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:30.510
What?

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:33.510
Someone named Jonouchi is calling you.

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:36.020
Jonouchi?

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:40.020
That scrub?  Let him through.

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:40.530
Yes, sir.

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:43.520
I think you reached him!

00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:45.180
O-Okay!

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:47.830
Kaiba!  I have a favor to ask!

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:51.560
Jonouchi, step away from the camera.

00:19:51.860 --> 00:19:55.300
Huh?  Sorry.

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:57.720
What do you want?

00:19:57.940 --> 00:19:59.800
We have a lead on Doma.

00:20:00.440 --> 00:20:01.600
Doma?

00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:04.610
It's at a Florida museum.

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:07.610
Help us get there.

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:09.820
Please, Kaiba!

00:20:09.820 --> 00:20:11.220
We have to hurry!

00:20:11.220 --> 00:20:14.000
Or else, the other Yugi's soul will be-

00:20:16.890 --> 00:20:18.330
Jonouchi, you dummy!

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:22.420
The other Yugi's soul?

00:20:24.630 --> 00:20:25.860
Never mind that.

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:28.600
You don't like occult-ish stuff anyway.

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:31.100
Right?

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:33.560
Yugi...  Can it be?

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:34.610
Did you lose?

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:36.610
S-Say what, Kaiba?

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:42.710
How dare you!

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:49.390
At the Duel Tower, you were given the Duel King title!

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:52.960
But someone unknown chump took it from you?

00:20:53.780 --> 00:20:54.690
Kaiba...

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:57.290
I misjudged you, Yugi!

00:20:57.290 --> 00:21:00.160
I don't want anything to do with a loser!

00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:05.300
Big brother...

00:21:07.140 --> 00:21:12.540
Doma, now I have another reason to crush you.

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:14.780
Kaiba...

00:21:15.180 --> 00:21:17.780
What's with that punk?

00:21:17.780 --> 00:21:21.640
Dammit!  Let's get there on our own!

00:21:21.640 --> 00:21:25.020
Yeah.  Professor, you rest.

00:21:25.570 --> 00:21:29.200
We'll get the research materials.

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:33.790
Otogi, come after the Professor's healed up.

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:35.320
Okay.

00:21:35.320 --> 00:21:38.990
How do we get to Florida?

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:43.040
To get to the nearest airport...

00:21:43.750 --> 00:21:46.040
We have to take the train.

00:21:57.870 --> 00:22:06.780
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:07.280 --> 00:22:15.190
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:26.280
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:26.890 --> 00:22:35.800
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:44.830
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:45.610 --> 00:22:50.340
I'll live feeling them

00:22:50.950 --> 00:22:55.520
For me to be me

00:22:55.520 --> 00:23:03.980
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:04.660 --> 00:23:09.620
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:10.140 --> 00:23:19.350
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:27.620 --> 00:23:32.490
Yugi hasn't recovered from the shock of losing his partner.

00:23:32.490 --> 00:23:36.710
But we have to act before Doma executes their next plan.

00:23:36.710 --> 00:23:42.650
We take a train to the Florida museum to recover documents about the ruins.

00:23:42.650 --> 00:23:47.810
By the way, I haven't seen Haga or Ryuzaki.  Where did they go?

00:23:47.810 --> 00:23:50.710
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Runaway Train Duel

00:23:50.710 --> 00:23:52.280
Duel, standby!
